    {
     "t": "verse",
     "pg": 117,
     "lines": [
      {
       "s": "There lies our country’s twofold tyranny,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "My father’s slayers, spoilers of my home.",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "Erst were they royal, sitting on the throne,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "And loving are they yet,—their common fate",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "Tells the tale truly, shows their trothplight firm.",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "They swore to work mine ill-starred father’s death,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "They swore to die together; ’tis fulfilled.",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "O ye who stand, this great doom’s witnesses,",
       "i": 1
      },
      {
       "s": "Behold this too, the dark device which bound",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "My sire unhappy to his death,—behold",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "The mesh which trapped his hands, enwound his feet!",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "Stand round, unfold it—’tis the trammel-net",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "That wrapped a chieftain; hold it that he see,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "The father—not my sire, but he whose eye",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "Is judge of all things, the all-seeing Sun!",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "Let him behold my mother’s damnèd deed,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "Then let him stand, when need shall be to me,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "Witness that justly I have sought and slain",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "My mother; blameless was Aegisthus’ doom—",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "He died the death law bids adulterers die.",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "But she who plotted this accursèd thing",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "To slay her lord, by whom she bare beneath",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "Her girdle once the burden of her babes,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "Beloved erewhile, now turned to hateful foes—",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "What deem ye of her? or what venomed thing,",
